{"id":"wb-5-195","name":"潭柘寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"潭柘寺","text":"岫云禅寺，通称潭柘（zhè）寺，位于中华人民共和国北京市门头沟区潭柘寺镇潭柘山山腰，在108国道上。它始建于西晋年间（265年-316年），当时叫嘉福寺，是北京市最早的一座寺庙，民间曾有“先有潭柘寺，后有北京城”（应该是“先有潭柘，后有幽州”）之说。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BD%AD%E6%9F%98%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92021246,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021246","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2e83876b5306c709ac6309d1.jpg","title":"Tanzhe_Si.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tanzhe_Si.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/Tanzhe_Si.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Tanzhe Temple","width":320,"height":240}}